{"seq":1,"slug":"dismantling-recycling-process","title":"拆解处置与资源化工艺模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/product-endoflife-waste-weee-compliance/treatment-recycling-data/dismantling-recycling-process","wordCount":2866,"readingTime":12,"html":"<h1 id=\"拆解处置与资源化工艺模型\">拆解处置与资源化工艺模型</h1><p>一台报废的笔记本电脑进入处理设施后，并不是被整体丢进粉碎机。它要先被&quot;去污染&quot;——扣出电池、拔掉含汞背光、拆下含多氯联苯的电容器；再被判分&quot;翻新转售&quot;还是&quot;拆件回收&quot;；只有剩下的机体才会被送入破碎分选线。这条流水线的每一步都对应一份法律义务和一组量化指标，而跨境卖家真正需要理解的是：<strong>你在合规申报里承诺的回收率，正是在这条线上被逐步&quot;挣&quot;回来的</strong>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-处置工艺链的三层结构\">核心概念：处置工艺链的三层结构</h2><p>WEEE 的处置不是单一工序，而是一条<strong>串联的、有优先级的工序链</strong>。欧盟把它拆成三个语义不同的阶段，各自对应不同的法律依据与验收指标。</p>\n<p>2025 年 10 月 ITU 与 UNITAR 联合发布的《全球电子废弃物监测》给出的量级，解释了为什么这条链必须工业化：2022 年全球产生 <strong>6200 万吨</strong>电子废弃物，按当前趋势 2030 年将升至 <strong>8200 万吨</strong>，而<strong>规范收集与回收率仅 22.3%</strong>，预计到 2030 年反降至约 20%，未能回收的金属等资源价值约 <strong>620 亿美元</strong>——数据来自 <a href=\"https://ewastemonitor.info/the-global-e-waste-monitor-2024/\">Global E-waste Monitor 2024</a>。这个缺口正是&quot;工艺模型&quot;要解决的问题：不是有没有处理设施，而是<strong>处理深度是否把材料真正分离出来</strong>。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  IN[入厂称重/登记] --&gt; DP[去污染&lt;br/&gt;de-pollution 强制]&#10;  DP --&gt; Q{整机可用?}&#10;  Q --&gt;|是| RU[再利用准备&lt;br/&gt;EN 50614]&#10;  Q --&gt;|否| DIS[选择性拆解&lt;br/&gt;高值件/危废件]&#10;  DIS --&gt; SH[破碎分选&lt;br/&gt;磁选/涡流/密度]&#10;  SH --&gt; M1[铁/铝/铜富集物]&#10;  SH --&gt; M2[塑料混合料]&#10;  SH --&gt; M3[PCB 富集物 → 贵金属精炼]&#10;  DP --&gt; HZ[危废支线&lt;br/&gt;电池/汞灯/制冷剂]&#10;  RU --&gt; OUT1[整机出海&lt;br/&gt;准备再利用]&#10;  M3 --&gt; OUT2[金属/材料产出]&#10;  HZ --&gt; INC[危废处置/再生]\">graph TD\n  IN[入厂称重/登记] --&gt; DP[去污染&lt;br/&gt;de-pollution 强制]\n  DP --&gt; Q{整机可用?}\n  Q --&gt;|是| RU[再利用准备&lt;br/&gt;EN 50614]\n  Q --&gt;|否| DIS[选择性拆解&lt;br/&gt;高值件/危废件]\n  DIS --&gt; SH[破碎分选&lt;br/&gt;磁选/涡流/密度]\n  SH --&gt; M1[铁/铝/铜富集物]\n  SH --&gt; M2[塑料混合料]\n  SH --&gt; M3[PCB 富集物 → 贵金属精炼]\n  DP --&gt; HZ[危废支线&lt;br/&gt;电池/汞灯/制冷剂]\n  RU --&gt; OUT1[整机出海&lt;br/&gt;准备再利用]\n  M3 --&gt; OUT2[金属/材料产出]\n  HZ --&gt; INC[危废处置/再生]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>工艺阶段</th>\n<th>主要目标</th>\n<th>法律依据</th>\n<th>关键产出</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>去污染（de-pollution）</td>\n<td>移除危险组件</td>\n<td>指令 2012/19/EU <a href=\"https://www.legislation.gov.uk/eudr/2012/19/annex/VII\">附件 VII</a></td>\n<td>制冷剂、汞背光、电池、含 PCB 电容</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>再利用准备</td>\n<td>保留整机功能价值</td>\n<td>EN 50614</td>\n<td>可转售二手整机/部件</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>选择性拆解</td>\n<td>回收高值件与危废件</td>\n<td>EN 50625-1 / 2-x</td>\n<td>硬盘、PCB、贵金属触点</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>破碎分选</td>\n<td>材料级分离</td>\n<td>EN 50625-1</td>\n<td>铁/铝/铜/塑料/PCB 富集物</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>材料精炼</td>\n<td>提纯为二次原料</td>\n<td>行业标准（冶炼厂）</td>\n<td>铜锭、金/银/钯、再生塑料</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>阶段之间的顺序不可颠倒：<strong>先去污染、后破碎</strong>，因为危险组件一旦被打碎混入物料流，就再也无法经济地分离，整批产出都可能被判为危废。</p>\n<h2 id=\"去污染-法律强制的第一道工序\">去污染：法律强制的第一道工序</h2><p>去污染不是&quot;环保加分项&quot;，而是<strong>合规的准入门槛</strong>。指令 2012/19/EU 附件 VII 明确要求处理设施必须先把特定组件取出，方可进行后续处理，其清单包括：含多氯联苯（PCB）的电容器、含汞组件（如冷阴极荧光背光）、电池、印刷电路板、外部电缆，以及含消耗臭氧层或全球升温潜能值较高气体的组件。执行层面的技术要求由 CENELEC 的 <a href=\"https://www.weee-forum.org/standards/\">EN 50625 系列</a>细化：通用要求见 EN 50625-1，分品类要求见 EN 50625-2-1（灯具）、EN 50625-2-2（含 CRT 与平板显示设备）、EN 50625-2-3（光伏组件）、EN 50625-2-4（温度交换设备）；去污染的具体规格由 CLC/TS 50625-3-x 系列给出。</p>\n<p>对跨境卖家最相关的是<strong>温度交换设备</strong>（冰箱、空调、除湿机）。这类设备含制冷剂与发泡剂，EN 50625-2-4 要求密闭抽取并记录回收量，因其中氢氟碳化物（HFC）的全球升温潜能值可达二氧化碳的千倍量级。报废后的抽取义务落在处理商身上，但<strong>费用最终由生产者责任组织（PRO）向生产者计收</strong>——这正是冰箱类产品 EPR 费率显著高于同重量小家电的原因。</p>\n<h2 id=\"拆解与再利用-价值优先级的量化\">拆解与再利用：价值优先级的量化</h2><p>成熟的处置商不会对每台设备做同一件事，而是按<strong>价值密度</strong>排序决策。一台设备入厂后，处理商估算三个量：拆解后单件物料的回收收益 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>G</mi><mi>d</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">G_d</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、整机翻新的转售收益 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>G</mi><mi>r</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">G_r</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、直接破碎的材料回收收益 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>G</mi><mi>s</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">G_s</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。决策规则近似为：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>V</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo fence=\"true\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">(</mo><msub><mi>G</mi><mi>r</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext>  </mtext><msub><mi>G</mi><mi>d</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mi>d</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext>  </mtext><msub><mi>G</mi><mi>s</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mi>s</mi></msub><mo fence=\"true\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V = \\max\\bigl(G_r,\\; G_d - C_d,\\; G_s - C_s\\bigr)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">max</span><span class=\"mopen\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mi>d</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_d</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是人工拆解成本，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mi>s</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_s</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是破碎分选成本。由于欧美人工成本高，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mi>d</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_d</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 往往是决定性变量：<strong>只有当拆解取出的部件价值超过人工工时，手工拆解才经济</strong>。这解释了行业里的一个反直觉现象——同一型号的手机，在人工成本低的地区会被逐颗螺丝拆解，在高人工成本地区则直接破碎，两者的<strong>法定回收率却可能相同</strong>，因为法规考核的是质量与去向，而非工艺路径。</p>\n<p>再利用在废弃物层级（waste hierarchy）中优先于回收。EN 50614 为&quot;再利用准备&quot;设定了功能测试、数据擦除与记录留存要求。这里有一个易被忽略的合规点：<strong>整机再利用的产品在部分成员国不计入回收率分子，但可计入&quot;已妥善处理&quot;的合规证明</strong>——它证明设备未流入非法渠道，却不一定能帮你填满回收率指标。拆解取出的物料则按品类进入下一阶段。</p>\n<h2 id=\"破碎分选与回收率模型\">破碎分选与回收率模型</h2><p>破碎分选线把混合物料变成单一材质的富集物。典型工序是：粗碎 → 磁选（分离铁）→ 涡电流分选（分离铝、铜等非铁金属）→ 密度/气流分选（分离塑料与轻料）→ 静电或传感分选（精细分离）。印刷电路板因含贵金属而被单独富集，送冶炼厂精炼——一吨废旧 PCB 的金含量通常高于一吨原矿，这正是&quot;城市矿山&quot;说法的来源。</p>\n<p>从合规角度，工艺线要交出的不是产能，而是一个<strong>回收率标量</strong>。指令 2012/19/EU <a href=\"https://www.legislation.gov.uk/eudr/2012/19/article/11\">第 11 条</a>按品类设定了回收（recovery）与再循环（recycling）双轨目标（2018 年 8 月 15 日起适用，替代此前较低的过渡值）：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>品类</th>\n<th>回收率 ≥</th>\n<th>再循环率 ≥</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>1、10（大型家电/大型设备）</td>\n<td>85%</td>\n<td>80%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>3、4（IT 与电信、消费电子）</td>\n<td>80%</td>\n<td>75%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2、5、6、7、8、9（小家电等）</td>\n<td>75%</td>\n<td>55%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>气体放电灯</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>80%</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>设施实际达成的回收率，取决于各物料流的分选效率与去向。在**质量平衡（mass balance）**口径下，可写成：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>R</mi><mtext>rec</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>i</mi></munder><msub><mi>m</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>η</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>θ</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><msub><mi>M</mi><mtext>in</mtext></msub></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R_{\\text{rec}} = \\frac{\\sum_i m_i \\cdot \\eta_i \\cdot \\theta_i}{M_{\\text{in}}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">rec</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.2757em;vertical-align:-0.836em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.4397em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">in</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.6897em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.162em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2997em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">η</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.836em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>M</mi><mtext>in</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">M_{\\text{in}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">in</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为入厂总重，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>m</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span> 类物料流质量，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>η</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\eta_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">η</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为分选纯度，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>θ</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\theta_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为该物料流被真正再循环（而非焚烧或填埋）的判定系数。工程含义很直接：<strong>提高 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">_</mi><mtext>rec</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R\\_{\\text{rec}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9933em;vertical-align:-0.31em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">_</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">rec</span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 有两条路——提高分选纯度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>η</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\eta_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">η</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，或提高去向系数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>θ</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\theta_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></strong>。前者是设备投入问题，后者是去向证明问题。第二条常被低估：分选出的塑料若因含阻燃剂而被判只能焚烧，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>θ</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\theta_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 归零，整条线的回收率随之被拖低。</p>\n<h2 id=\"危险废物鉴别与跨境转移\">危险废物鉴别与跨境转移</h2><p>拆解产生的部分物料在离开设施前就已注定进入危废通道，而非回收通道。常见的对应关系是：含汞背光与汞开关、废铅酸电池、含 PCB 的电容器、以及含镉的旧式电池。这些物料的<strong>跨境转移受《巴塞尔公约》管辖</strong>。2022 年缔约方大会通过的修正案自 <strong>2025 年 1 月 1 日起生效</strong>，其核心变化是：<strong>无论是危险还是非危险的电子废弃物，其越境转移一律适用事先知情同意程序（PIC）</strong>。条目上，非危险电子废弃物列入附件 II 的 <strong>Y49</strong>，危险电子废弃物由新条目 <strong>A1181</strong> 取代原 A1180，附件 IX 中的 B1110、B4030 被删除——依据 <a href=\"https://www.basel.int/Implementation/Ewaste/Overview/tabid/4063/Default.aspx\">巴塞尔公约电子废弃物专栏</a>。</p>\n<p>对跨境卖家而言，这条规则的实务含义是：<strong>把报废品&quot;出口&quot;到低成本地区处理的路径正在收窄</strong>。此前非危险电子废弃物的越境相对宽松，2025 年起需取得进口国与过境国的书面同意，任一环节缺失即构成非法运输，这也反过来推动欧盟境内处理产能本地化。</p>\n<p>危险废物的<strong>鉴别标准</strong>在各法域并不统一。中国的《国家危险废物名录》以 HW 编码分类，电子废弃物拆解相关条目多归入 HW49（如废电路板、废电池），与欧盟的&quot;危险特性&quot;判定路径不同。同一批物料在中欧两地可能得出不同的危废判定，进而影响处置成本与转移可行性——卖家必须先在方案中明确<strong>适用哪一法域的鉴别规则</strong>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"数据与追溯-处置环节的可核验性\">数据与追溯：处置环节的可核验性</h2><p>处置环节是回收率申报的<strong>证据生产地</strong>。监管和 PRO 需要的不只是一句&quot;已回收&quot;，而是可追溯的质量平衡与去向证明。可核验性通常由三层材料构成：处理商的<strong>资质与认证</strong>（EN 50625 符合性、WEEELABEX 审计）、<strong>质量平衡台账</strong>（入厂重量与各类产出重量可对账）、以及<strong>下游去向证明</strong>（冶炼厂或回收商的接收凭证）。三者缺一，回收率声明就无法通过审计。</p>\n<p>这条证据链正在被资源化政策进一步强化。欧盟《关键原材料法案》（Regulation 2024/1252）设定了 2030 年基准：<strong>至少 25% 的年度消费量由回收满足</strong>，并要求成员国改善富含关键原材料的废弃物的收集与再生——依据<a href=\"https://single-market-economy.ec.europa.eu/sectors/raw-materials/areas-specific-interest/critical-raw-materials/critical-raw-materials-act_en\">欧盟委员会关键原材料法案页面</a>。与此同时，《电池法规》（Regulation 2023/1542）自 2024 年 2 月 18 日起适用、要求分阶段落地至 2031 年，其中包含再生含量与电池护照等机制——依据<a href=\"https://environment.ec.europa.eu/topics/waste-and-recycling/batteries_en\">欧盟委员会电池专题页</a>。这些政策把&quot;处置数据&quot;从合规附件提升为<strong>资源供应链的输入</strong>：一台设备的拆解去向，正在变成它所用材料能否标注&quot;再生含量&quot;的凭据。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[入厂登记&lt;br/&gt;重量/品类] --&gt; B[去污染记录&lt;br/&gt;危废转移联单]&#10;  A --&gt; C[拆解产出台账]&#10;  C --&gt; D[质量平衡对账]&#10;  D --&gt; E[分选物料去向凭证]&#10;  E --&gt; F[回收率声明]&#10;  B --&gt; G[危废合规证明]&#10;  F --&gt; H[PRO/监管申报]&#10;  G --&gt; H\">graph TD\n  A[入厂登记&lt;br/&gt;重量/品类] --&gt; B[去污染记录&lt;br/&gt;危废转移联单]\n  A --&gt; C[拆解产出台账]\n  C --&gt; D[质量平衡对账]\n  D --&gt; E[分选物料去向凭证]\n  E --&gt; F[回收率声明]\n  B --&gt; G[危废合规证明]\n  F --&gt; H[PRO/监管申报]\n  G --&gt; H</pre><p>对卖家的直接影响是：选处理商时，<strong>报价低不等于总成本低</strong>。一个缺少质量平衡台账的处理商，其出具的去向证明可能在 PRO 审计中被驳回，导致卖家需要重新安排处置并承担二次费用。处置与循环利用是回收渠道网络的下游——上游渠道如何把废弃产品接住，见<a href=\"../../waste-collection-network/takeback-channel-network-model\">回收渠道与回收点网络模型</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>处置链分三层：<strong>去污染是法定前置</strong>，拆解与再利用按价值决策，破碎分选负责材料级分离；顺序不可颠倒。</li>\n<li>2018 年起适用的回收目标按品类分档：大型设备 85%/80%，IT 与消费电子 80%/75%，小家电 75%/55%，气体放电灯 80% 再循环。</li>\n<li>回收率模型 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>R</mi><mtext>rec</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mo>∑</mo><mi>i</mi></msub><msub><mi>m</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><msub><mi>η</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><msub><mi>θ</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msub><mi>M</mi><mtext>in</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R_{\\text{rec}} = \\sum_i m_i\\eta_i\\theta_i / M_{\\text{in}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">rec</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0497em;vertical-align:-0.2997em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.162em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2997em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">η</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">in</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 说明提升路径有两条：分选纯度与<strong>去向系数</strong>，后者常被低估。</li>\n<li>危险组件的去污染由指令附件 VII 强制，具体规格由 EN 50625 系列落地。</li>\n<li>巴塞尔公约自 2025 年 1 月 1 日起对全部电子废弃物越境适用 PIC，非危险品归入 Y49、危险品归入 A1181。</li>\n<li>处置数据正被《关键原材料法案》（2030 年 25% 回收基准）与电池护照等机制重新定义为资源供应链输入，可追溯质量平衡与去向证明成为硬性验收材料。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"拆解处置与资源化工艺模型","id":"拆解处置与资源化工艺模型"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：处置工艺链的三层结构","id":"核心概念-处置工艺链的三层结构"},{"level":2,"text":"去污染：法律强制的第一道工序","id":"去污染-法律强制的第一道工序"},{"level":2,"text":"拆解与再利用：价值优先级的量化","id":"拆解与再利用-价值优先级的量化"},{"level":2,"text":"破碎分选与回收率模型","id":"破碎分选与回收率模型"},{"level":2,"text":"危险废物鉴别与跨境转移","id":"危险废物鉴别与跨境转移"},{"level":2,"text":"数据与追溯：处置环节的可核验性","id":"数据与追溯-处置环节的可核验性"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"上门取件与回收异常处置","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/product-endoflife-waste-weee-compliance/waste-collection-network/pickup-collection-exception-handling"},"next":{"title":"回收率与处置数据核算方法","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/product-endoflife-waste-weee-compliance/treatment-recycling-data/recycling-rate-data-accounting"}}